From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:16:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1384/3799] soh: rename func_80A88F64 -> EnJs_OfferTalk

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: shared talk helper: returns 1 when the player accepts, otherwise sets the given text id and offers talk while they are within 100 units and closely in front, flagging head tracking on for that frame.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Js/z_en_js.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Js/z_en_js.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Js/z_en_js.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Js/z_en_js.c
index c7c9c844c..1e599caff 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Js/z_en_js.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Js/z_en_js.c
@@ -80,7 +80,8 @@ void EnJs_Destroy(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     Collider_DestroyCylinder(play, &this->collider);
 }
 
-u8 func_80A88F64(EnJs* this, PlayState* play, u16 textId) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A88F64: shared talk helper: returns 1 when the player accepts, otherwise sets the given text id and offers talk while they are within 100 units and closely in front, flagging head tracking on for that frame.
+u8 EnJs_OfferTalk(EnJs* this, PlayState* play, u16 textId) {
     s16 yawDiff;
 
     if (Actor_ProcessTalkRequest(&this->actor, play)) {
@@ -172,7 +173,7 @@ void func_80A89294(EnJs* this) {
 }
 
 void func_80A89304(EnJs* this, PlayState* play) {
-    if (func_80A88F64(this, play, 0x6077)) {
+    if (EnJs_OfferTalk(this, play, 0x6077)) {  // was func_80A88F64 [LLM:HIGH]
         func_80A89294(this);
     }
 }
